<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka 1996 tea crop at record 258.4 million kg.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka 1996 tea crop at record 258.4 million kg.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's 1996 black tea production soared to an all-time high 258.4 million kg, the Tea Board said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 1996 production recorded an increase of five percent from the previous year's production of 245.96 million kg, it said.</p>
</text>
